OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will get off to a cloudy
OL,6,Fand breezy start with some showery
OL,7,Frain possible. The showers will become
OL,8,Fmore isolated through the morning and
OL,9,Ffor the afternoon, with some warm
OL,10,Fspells of sunshine developing at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FApart from a very isolated
OL,13,Flight shower it will be a dry evening
OL,14,Fand night. There will be sunshine to
OL,15,Fend the day, with clear spells
OL,16,Fovernight. Breezy, though mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
