OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMonday will get off to a dry
OL,6,Fstart with bright spells, and it
OL,7,Fshould remain dry throughout the day
OL,8,Fwith an increasingly sunny afternoon
OL,9,Funfolding. Pleasantly warm in gentle
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,13,Fweather looks mostly dry and settled
OL,14,Fduring the period. There will be
OL,15,Fplenty of sunshine, and it will feel
OL,16,Fincreasing warm again in the lighter
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
